{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"angular-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Angular Snippets","description":"Components, services, modules, signals, routing and forms for Angular.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"TypeScript","path":"snippets/typescript.json"},{"language":"HTML / XML","path":"snippets/html-xml.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/typescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { Component } from '@angular/core';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"@Component({\",\n      \"  selector: 'app-${1:name}',\",\n      \"  standalone: true,\",\n      \"  templateUrl: './${1:name}.component.html',\",\n      \"})\",\n      \"export class ${2:Name}Component {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A standalone component\"\n  },\n  \"Inline component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngci\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { Component } from '@angular/core';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"@Component({\",\n      \"  selector: 'app-${1:name}',\",\n      \"  standalone: true,\",\n      \"  template: `<p>${2:content}</p>`,\",\n      \"})\",\n      \"export class ${3:Name}Component {}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A component with an inline template\"\n  },\n  \"Service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngs\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { Injectable } from '@angular/core';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"@Injectable({ providedIn: 'root' })\",\n      \"export class ${1:Name}Service {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An injectable service\"\n  },\n  \"Inject\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nginj\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"private readonly ${1:service} = inject(${2:Service});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"inject()\"\n  },\n  \"Signal\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngsig\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"readonly ${1:count} = signal(${2:0});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A signal\"\n  },\n  \"Computed\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngcomp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"readonly ${1:double} = computed(() => this.${2:count}() * 2);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A computed signal\"\n  },\n  \"Effect\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngeff\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"effect(() => {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An effect\"\n  },\n  \"Input\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngin\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} = input<${2:string}>(${3:''});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A signal input\"\n  },\n  \"Output\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngout\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:changed} = output<${2:string}>();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An output\"\n  },\n  \"HTTP get\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nghttp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"this.http.get<${1:Item[]}>(`${2:/api/items}`).subscribe((${3:items}) => {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An HTTP GET\"\n  },\n  \"Routes\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngroutes\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export const routes: Routes = [\",\n      \"  { path: '${1:home}', component: ${2:HomeComponent} },\",\n      \"  { path: '**', redirectTo: '${1:home}' },\",\n      \"];\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A routes array\"\n  },\n  \"Route guard\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nguard\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export const ${1:auth}Guard: CanActivateFn = (route, state) => {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"  return true;\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A functional guard\"\n  },\n  \"Reactive form\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngform\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"readonly form = new FormGroup({\",\n      \"  ${1:name}: new FormControl('', { nonNullable: true, validators: [Validators.required] }),\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A reactive form group\"\n  },\n  \"Pipe\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngpipe\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@Pipe({ name: '${1:name}', standalone: true })\",\n      \"export class ${2:Name}Pipe implements PipeTransform {\",\n      \"  transform(value: ${3:string}): ${3:string} {\",\n      \"    return $0;\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A pipe\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/html-xml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ngIf block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngif\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@if (${1:condition}) {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"} @else {\",\n      \"  \",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@if block\"\n  },\n  \"ngFor block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngfor\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@for (${1:item} of ${2:items}; track ${1:item}.${3:id}) {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"} @empty {\",\n      \"  <p>Nothing here</p>\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@for block\"\n  },\n  \"Switch block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngswitch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@switch (${1:value}) {\",\n      \"  @case (${2:1}) { $0 }\",\n      \"  @default { }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@switch block\"\n  },\n  \"Defer block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngdefer\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@defer (on viewport) {\",\n      \"  <${1:app-heavy} />\",\n      \"} @placeholder {\",\n      \"  <p>Loading</p>\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"@defer block\"\n  },\n  \"Two-way binding\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngmodel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<input [(ngModel)]=\\\"${1:value}\\\" name=\\\"${1:value}\\\">\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"ngModel\"\n  },\n  \"Event binding\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngclick\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(click)=\\\"${1:onClick}(\\\\$event)\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A click handler\"\n  },\n  \"Router link\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngrl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<a routerLink=\\\"/${1:path}\\\" routerLinkActive=\\\"active\\\">${2:Label}</a>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A routerLink\"\n  },\n  \"Form field\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ngfield\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<input formControlName=\\\"${1:name}\\\">\",\n      \"@if (form.controls.${1:name}.invalid && form.controls.${1:name}.touched) {\",\n      \"  <small>Required</small>\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A reactive form field\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Angular Snippets\n\nComponents, services, modules, signals, routing and forms for Angular.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 22 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| TypeScript | `ngc` | A standalone component |\n| TypeScript | `ngci` | A component with an inline template |\n| TypeScript | `ngs` | An injectable service |\n| TypeScript | `nginj` | inject() |\n| TypeScript | `ngsig` | A signal |\n| TypeScript | `ngcomp` | A computed signal |\n| TypeScript | `ngeff` | An effect |\n| TypeScript | `ngin` | A signal input |\n| TypeScript | `ngout` | An output |\n| TypeScript | `nghttp` | An HTTP GET |\n| TypeScript | `ngroutes` | A routes array |\n| TypeScript | `nguard` | A functional guard |\n| TypeScript | `ngform` | A reactive form group |\n| TypeScript | `ngpipe` | A pipe |\n| HTML / XML | `ngif` | @if block |\n| HTML / XML | `ngfor` | @for block |\n| HTML / XML | `ngswitch` | @switch block |\n| HTML / XML | `ngdefer` | @defer block |\n| HTML / XML | `ngmodel` | ngModel |\n| HTML / XML | `ngclick` | A click handler |\n| HTML / XML | `ngrl` | A routerLink |\n| HTML / XML | `ngfield` | A reactive form field |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}